<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>异步 on 404_@林达</title><link>https://linsk27.github.io/tags/%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5/</link><description>Recent content in 异步 on 404_@林达</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>404_@林达</copyright><lastBuildDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linsk27.github.io/tags/%E5%BC%82%E6%AD%A5/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>JavaScript 事件循环初步理解：同步、微任务、宏任务</title><link>https://linsk27.github.io/p/javascript-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%88%9D%E6%AD%A5%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E5%BE%AE%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%AE%8F%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://linsk27.github.io/p/javascript-%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF%E5%88%9D%E6%AD%A5%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E5%BE%AE%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E5%AE%8F%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1/</guid><description>&lt;p>事件循环是前端异步代码绕不开的基础。只要页面里用了 &lt;code>Promise&lt;/code>、&lt;code>async/await&lt;/code>、定时器或接口请求，就会遇到执行顺序的问题。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>先给一个实用结论：当前同步代码执行完后，JavaScript 会优先清空微任务队列，再进入下一轮任务去执行定时器等宏任务。&lt;code>setTimeout(fn, 0)&lt;/code> 不是立刻执行，它只是把 &lt;code>fn&lt;/code> 放进后续任务队列。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="同步微任务宏任务分别是什么">同步、微任务、宏任务分别是什么
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>同步代码会直接进入调用栈，按从上到下的顺序运行。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>微任务常见来源是 &lt;code>Promise.then&lt;/code>、&lt;code>catch&lt;/code>、&lt;code>finally&lt;/code>、&lt;code>queueMicrotask&lt;/code>，以及 &lt;code>async/await&lt;/code> 中 &lt;code>await&lt;/code> 后面继续执行的部分。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>宏任务常见来源是 &lt;code>setTimeout&lt;/code>、&lt;code>setInterval&lt;/code>、用户交互事件和部分 I/O 回调。不同运行环境对任务来源的细节有区别，但浏览器开发中先掌握这套顺序已经足够解决大多数问题。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="看一个最常见的输出顺序">看一个最常见的输出顺序
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>把下面代码复制到浏览器控制台：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;1：同步开始&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">setTimeout&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;4：定时器任务&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">Promise&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">resolve&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">().&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">then&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;3：Promise 微任务&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;2：同步结束&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>输出顺序是：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">1：同步开始
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">2：同步结束
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">3：Promise 微任务
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">4：定时器任务
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>原因是两条 &lt;code>console.log&lt;/code> 都是同步代码，会先执行。&lt;code>Promise.then&lt;/code> 进入微任务队列，&lt;code>setTimeout&lt;/code> 回调进入后续任务队列。调用栈清空后，浏览器先执行微任务，最后才轮到定时器回调。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="多个微任务按进入顺序执行">多个微任务按进入顺序执行
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>微任务不会互相抢占，而是按加入队列的先后顺序依次执行。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;A&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nb">Promise&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">resolve&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">().&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">then&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;C&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">queueMicrotask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;D&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">setTimeout&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;E&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;B&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>输出顺序是 &lt;code>A -&amp;gt; B -&amp;gt; C -&amp;gt; D -&amp;gt; E&lt;/code>。这里 &lt;code>Promise.then&lt;/code> 比 &lt;code>queueMicrotask&lt;/code> 先注册，所以它也先执行；两个都完成后，才会执行定时器回调。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="async--await-为什么看起来像异步暂停">async / await 为什么看起来像异步暂停
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>&lt;code>async&lt;/code> 函数在遇到 &lt;code>await&lt;/code> 前仍然是同步执行的。&lt;code>await&lt;/code> 后面的代码会被放入微任务队列。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">async&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">function&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">printOrder&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;1：进入 async 函数&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="kr">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">Promise&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">resolve&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;3：await 后继续执行&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">printOrder&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">console&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;2：外层同步代码&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>输出是：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">1：进入 async 函数
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">2：外层同步代码
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">3：await 后继续执行
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>所以 &lt;code>await&lt;/code> 并不会阻塞整个页面，它只暂停当前 &lt;code>async&lt;/code> 函数。其他同步代码仍然会先走完。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="在-vue-中什么时候用-nexttick">在 Vue 中什么时候用 nextTick
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Vue 修改响应式数据后，不会每改一个值就立刻更新 DOM，而是会把更新合并。需要拿到更新后的真实 DOM 时，用 &lt;code>nextTick&lt;/code> 比 &lt;code>setTimeout&lt;/code> 更准确。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-vue" data-lang="vue">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">script&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">setup&lt;/span> &lt;span class="na">lang&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;ts&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">nextTick&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">ref&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;vue&amp;#39;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">visible&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">ref&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">openDialog&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">async&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">visible&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">value&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">nextTick&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nb">document&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">querySelector&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">HTMLInputElement&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;#search-input&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">?&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">focus&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">script&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>nextTick&lt;/code> 的语义是“等 Vue 完成本轮 DOM 更新后再执行”，而不是单纯延迟一会儿。它更适合处理弹窗打开后聚焦、列表更新后滚动到底部这类需求。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="一个容易忽略的问题">一个容易忽略的问题
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>微任务不是越多越好。每一轮宏任务结束后，浏览器会先清空当前微任务队列。若在微任务里不断创建新的微任务，渲染和用户交互就可能被推迟。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">runForever&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">queueMicrotask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">runForever&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">runForever&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这类代码会让浏览器一直处理微任务，页面可能失去响应。实际业务里，耗时计算应该拆分处理，或者交给 Web Worker，避免堵住主线程。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="小结">小结
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>理解事件循环后，排查异步顺序可以按这个步骤走：先找同步代码，再找 &lt;code>Promise&lt;/code> 和 &lt;code>await&lt;/code> 产生的微任务，最后看 &lt;code>setTimeout&lt;/code> 等后续任务。大部分“为什么这个日志先出来”“为什么 DOM 还没更新”的问题，都会变得清楚很多。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>